{"text": " You wake up in 1821 in London. Colesmoke, wet cobbles, and a queue outside the Bank of England. Did you know that Bank of England notes still say, I promised to pay the bearer on demand? Back then, that promised meant gold. A five-pound note could be swapped for five gold coins, sovereigns. For 24 years through the wars with France, the bank had stopped paying out gold. Paper took over, so did foragers, and many of them were hanged. Now the bank is paying gold again. Paper you can turn into metal any day you like. So what is money now? As good as gold, a promise you can swap for metal. Over the next century, much of the world follows Britain on to gold. Gold becomes the anchor, and anchors feel safe. But in 1971, one television speech cuts the rope.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.26, "text": " You wake up in 1821 in London.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 2443, 4436, 294, 7042, 13, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1968400661761944, "compression_ratio": 1.5854545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 0.01853243075311184, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12, "probability": 0.6440912485122681}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.3, "probability": 0.9793214201927185}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.46, "probability": 0.9991307854652405}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.56, "probability": 0.9648066759109497}, {"word": " 1821", "start": 0.56, "end": 1.42, "probability": 0.9857743680477142}, {"word": " in", "start": 1.42, "end": 1.94, "probability": 0.9123983979225159}, {"word": " London.", "start": 1.94, "end": 2.26, "probability": 0.9917188882827759}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.1799999999999997, "end": 7.08, "text": " Colesmoke, wet cobbles, and a queue outside the Bank of England.", "tokens": [50514, 4004, 279, 76, 2949, 11, 6630, 598, 45176, 11, 293, 257, 18639, 2380, 264, 8915, 295, 8196, 13, 50752], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1968400661761944, "compression_rat